 "text": "Hi, how are things with her? Great way to absorb content without looking at screen. Would you rather listen during a commute, at the gym, or at home while doing yawns? Then try chefs without reslies, a cooking show where the hosts also eat every dish. Or history podcasts like You Are From History, if you can get past the title. Not at first. Keep an old phone by the radio just in case. Or you can use the smartphone app as long as you still have a signal. Then try The Social History, ten minutes on strange historical events. Or The Kitchen Counter, ten minutes on recipes and history.",
